abstract: >
  exact_diagonalization_cpp is a research-grade C++/CUDA toolkit for
  exact diagonalization (ED) of quantum spin lattice models. It supports
  full diagonalization (LAPACK / ScaLAPACK), the Lanczos family
  (standard, selective reorthogonalization, block, shift-invert,
  Chebyshev-filtered, implicitly restarted, thick-restart, Krylov-Schur),
  ARPACK with auto-tuning, finite-temperature methods (FTLM, LTLM,
  Hybrid, microcanonical TPQ, canonical TPQ), and dynamical/static
  spin structure factors (DSSF/SSSF). GPU acceleration is provided
  for Lanczos / FTLM / TPQ via CUDA. MPI parallelism is supported for
  TPQ sample-parallel runs and ScaLAPACK distributed full diagonalization.
  A numerical linked-cluster expansion (NLCE) workflow is included.
